<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Carousel chevron, left. Converted verbatim from the Figma export
    "Group (1).svg": 26x40 viewBox, black fill with a 1-unit white stroke.

    1 viewport unit = 1dp, so the outline keeps its weight no matter what
    box the ImageView gives it (see Widget.Find.CarouselArrow, which uses
    scaleType="center" to draw it at its intrinsic size).

    autoMirrored so the glyph flips in RTL. Paired with the start/end gravity
    in the layouts, that keeps both arrows pointing outward in either
    language: in Arabic "previous" sits on the right and this drawable
    mirrors to point right.

    The Figma export wrapped this path in <g opacity="0.5"> — that's the
    disabled state of the arrow in the mock (the frame shows the first
    image, so "previous" is unavailable), not part of the asset, so it is
    deliberately not baked in here.
-->
